<p>
This is the flat, per-listing view of the same data as <a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}sources/traders/">Traders</a>:
every entry of every <code>config/tradelists/*.json</code> <code>selling</code>/<code>buying</code> array, one
table row each. See that page for how the files are read and how specializations are tied to trader entities.
</p>
<p>
A listing's <code>price</code> is per stack, and <code>stock</code> is a number of stacks (each holding
<code>stacksize</code> items) -- the table shows them as separate columns rather than a combined "stock &times; size".
</p>
